  m_Text: "PLACEHOLDER MECHANIC\n\nThis level will compare movie/item features directly:\n\n\u2022
    read a movie's explicit attributes\n\u2022 match those attributes to a customer's
    stated need\n\u2022 expose why content-based systems miss hidden collaborative
    taste\n\nFor now this slot preserves the real five-level structure and routes
    into collaborative filtering."
